Z||000001||PBJ||06-27-2001||09:11 AM||||you would be looking for the HIGH OUTPUT QUAD 4. it has 180 hp. is around 89-91 g/a and beretta gtz. with 5spd  You can tell by looking at the top it says high output and is aluminum with black rather than just aluminum.  Other Q4's have 140-160 hp depending on year and were 2.3l in 96 went to 2.4 l and 150 horse (which is more reliable)<P>olds calias.  any gm "N" body<p>[This message has been edited by PBJ (edited 06-27-2001).]||||reg||1
