Z||000003||Will||06-27-2001||03:50 PM||||You don't want a '96. That was a transitional year.<P>If you take the HO cylinder head, you can bolt it onto the 97+ 2.4 litre short block. If you remove the balance shaft, over 200HP is easily accessible.||||reg||1
